      "updated": 1775770699444,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Infrastructure\n- Message Broker : CloudAMQP\n- DataBase : Postgres(neon)\n- Caching : Redis Cloud\n- Storage (CDN) : MiniO S3\n- AI Provides :\n    - TTS : Bhashini AI\n    - TOC : light weigh llm Ai Groq\n- FrameWork: Gin\n-Language : Go\n",
      "fontSize": 20.501072288598113,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Infrastructure\n- Message Broker : CloudAMQP\n- DataBase : Postgres(neon)\n- Caching : Redis Cloud\n- Storage (CDN) : MiniO S3\n- AI Provides :\n    - TTS : Bhashini AI\n    - TOC : light weigh llm Ai Groq\n- FrameWork: Gin\n-Language : Go\n",
